It is unfortunate when a good debate between well-meaning people
deteriorates.

There will be a careful re-thinking of "sudden death" features of
the game for 3.1.  It is too late for Pl8.  3.0 is now as fully debugged
of all known bugs, it is stabilized, and it is "frozen" in place.  As
soon as we get the go-ahead from the PC overlay team (expected at any
moment, now), we will release Pl8.  We will NOT do anything at this point
which might disturb the present balance of the game, let alone bug it.
The best way to ensure this is not to make any more changes.  That's a
non-negotiable firm decision.

In re-thinking the "sudden death" features we will be moved by arguments,
not by votes.  Keep on posting and emailing your views.  What we'll end up
doing is likely to satisfy some but not others.  That's the nature of the
process.

For the Development Team,

-Izchak


